{"text":" = .seconds(30 * 60), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kinds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionEventKind","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEventKind","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Sessions16SessionEventKindO"},{"text":"> = Set(SessionEventKind.allCases), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"file","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#file","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#fileID","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"function","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#function","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#line","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"column","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#column","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"timeout","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The inactivity after which the next event starts a new session; 30 minutes by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"kinds","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The session events to track; both by default. Leaving one out, or both, tracks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none of that kind, and every record still carries its session’s key."}]}]},{"name":"file","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s file; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"fileID","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s module and file name; leave it to its default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"function","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s enclosing declaration; leave it to its default."}]}]},{"name":"line","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s line; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"column","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s column; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher, which runs on the tracker’s worker like any other."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing is put in a session until the app turns it on, among the enrichers it builds its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker with, so every event the tracker tracks carries the key, through any copy of it:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.sessions()])"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Inactivity is measured between records’ timestamps, the time each event was tracked, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not when the tracker’s worker reaches it. So the app returning from the background past the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timeout starts a new session with its first event, such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ApplicationOpened"},{"text":" (module","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LifecycleTracking"},{"text":"), and one returning sooner goes on with the same.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The first event the tracker tracks starts the first session: ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","isActive":true},{"text":" comes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before it, stamped with its time. A session ends only when an event comes after the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timeout: ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","isActive":true},{"text":", stamped with the time of the session’s last event, then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","isActive":true},{"text":", stamped with the new event’s, come before that event. So a run’s last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session ends with no ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","isActive":true},{"text":": a destination takes its end from its last event. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session event carries the key of the session it starts or ends, and the context the event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that ended the session had when this enricher reached it; the enrichers after this one run","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on them too. Their call site is this call’s.","type":"text"}]},{"typ